@startuml
!pragma charset UTF-8
title UC-Ring Design — Select, Configure or Submit Reference Image
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #FCF9F8
  BorderColor #807663
  ArrowColor #5B5E67
}

start
|Guest or Member|
:Choose design approach;
if (Approved ring model?) then (yes)
  |System|
  :Load Owner-confirmed model;
  :Mark route as catalogue design;
  stop
elseif (Component configurator?) then (yes)
  |Guest or Member|
  :Choose available component options;
  |System|
  :Validate against approved components\nand hard constraints;
  if (Selection valid?) then (yes)
    :Mark route as configured design;
  else (no)
    :Explain constraint and require a valid selection;
  endif
  stop
else (Reference image)
  |Guest or Member|
  :Read consent wording and give explicit consent;
  :Submit reference image;
  |System|
  :Validate request, consent and rate limit;
  if (Request accepted?) then (yes)
    |AI Vision API|
    :Assess image quality;
    :Return candidate features only;
    |System|
    :Evaluate candidate features with approved\nhard constraints, scores and thresholds;
    if (Simple) then (auto-accept)
      :Record auditable feasibility decision;
      :Show feasible design path;
    elseif (Medium) then (Staff review)
      :Create Staff review request;
      |Staff / Consultant|
      :Review feasibility and optionally override;
      |System|
      :Record actor, reason and decision context;
      :Show reviewed result;
    elseif (Advanced) then (Owner review)
      :Create Owner review request;
      |Owner / Manager|
      :Review feasibility and optionally override;
      |System|
      :Record actor, reason and decision context;
      :Show reviewed result;
    else (Impossible)
      :Record approved rejection reason/context;
      :Ask customer to choose another option;
    endif
  else (no)
    :Do not send image to AI;
    :Show consent, quality or rate-limit error;
  endif
endif

note right
AI cannot decide the final price or feasibility; it only returns image quality and candidate features.
Scoring, thresholds, evaluation dataset and retention wording remain Open/TBD.
end note
stop
@enduml
